<P>各位老师：</P>
<P><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">为提高老师们的心理健康知识水平，促进专业发展，同时作为我校创建省现代化学校的一项硬指标、硬任务，学校将继续组织一批还未取得心理健康<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>证的老师参加新的培训。另外，由于一大批已经取得<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>证老师的证书有效期已经过期，按照规定需要参加继续教育方可续期。新的<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>证培训及续期培训均安排在本校或通过网络进行。具体事项如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US> </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; COLOR: black; amp: ; quot: ; serif: "><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-BREAK: break-all; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); TEXT-ALIGN: left; FONT: 14px/170% "宋体"; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px'></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">一、新C证培训</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; COLOR: black; amp: ; quot: ; serif: "><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; WORD-BREAK: break-all; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); TEXT-ALIGN: left; FONT: 14px/170% "宋体"; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px'></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">1. </SPAN></FONT><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">参加对象：尚未取得<SPAN lang=EN-US>c</SPAN>证的教师（名单附后）。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">2.培训形式：3天地面课程+2天网络直播课程+半天考试</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">3.培训安排：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090316150958.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090316150958.png" width=1292 height=224> </A></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090316135946.png" target=_blank></A></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">二、C证续期培训</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">1.参加对象：2017年及以前取得C证已过期的老师，名单附后（C证有效期3年，依照C证工作要求，需参加8课时继续教育方可续证）</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">2.培训形式：钉钉直播线上课程</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">3.培训安排：9月6日本周日一天</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090316201050.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090316201050.png" width=1289 height=68> </A></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">三、相关说明</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">1.为方便老师，本次培训由原本5天地面课程改为2天网课加3天地面，地面课尽量不占用周日休息时间。钉钉直播过程中或者周六涉及课务的老师可临时离开一会去上课，其他时间请准时参加，C证培训由市心指办主办，依照规定对考勤有严格要求，请各位老师理解。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">2.若名单中有遗漏或者错误的，请与王佩金联系。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: &amp;quot; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; 宋体: ; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" align=left><FONT face=等线><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
